summary = A trainer salary. Your mom starts you off, then OAK, BILL, the GAME CORNER, SILPH CO. and the LEAGUE take over.
author = Dileppy
tags = mechanic, economy, progression, ui
differences = Adds a CAREER screen to the START menu and pays a small stipend on the in-game clock. Changes no battle mechanics and no shop prices.
credits = Built on the Gen1Recomp mod API by bryanthaboi.
